---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<Base title="Contact" description={`Contact ${site.name} about a download, a print problem, or a coloring set you want next.`} path="/contact/">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Write to us</h1>
    <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. There is no account and no comment box. That is deliberate: this is a printable library, not a place for children to post.</p>
    <p>Useful notes include the page you were on, whether you wanted US Letter or A4, and what the printer did. If you want a set that is not here yet, name the theme and the age. Big shapes are ages 2–3. Animals, dinosaurs, cars, princesses, and the holiday pages are the ages 3–4 shelf. Garden scenes are ages 4–5, ocean scenes are ages 5–6, and town scenes are ages 6–8.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
